                        <span class="list-number">2</span> Only properly tagged customers and/or sub-affiliates can be assigned to an affiliate. Should an affiliate tag be improperly inserted into the affiliate site or not properly received by the 12BET web server the resulting customer and/or sub-affiliates registration and purchases will not be assigned to the affiliate. Therefore it is the responsibility of the affiliate to ensure that all links are properly tagged.
